WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
A repeatable environment needs
more than a container that starts.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.680
Pin the service image, test commit,
schema, fixtures and provider model.

00:00:08.754 --> 00:00:12.640
Create isolated accounts and verify
their initial balances before execution.

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:17.120
Shared mutable accounts would
invalidate the financial assertions.

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:20.400
Testcontainers can supply
disposable dependencies,

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.120
while WireMock models the provider.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.000
Resolve every placeholder to an immutable
version, retain preflight results,

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.200
and keep real-provider
integration as a separate check.
